    "Replace 2nd-order torch.autograd.grad critic penalty and protected-loss gradients with strictly 1st-order forward-mode AD (fwAD) / live-endpoint secant / standard .backward() paths so t4_nash_v3 executes with strictly 0 svd, 0 eigh, 0 pinv, 0 Newton-Schulz, and 0 torch.autograd.grad calls.",
