    "Fix 1D equilibrium variance via exact O(B log B) quantile Monge displacement, dim==1 Born-Infeld tail scale (tau_mult=1.0), and 2-mode median-cliff variance floor max(median(d2), sum(var)).",
    "Preserve first/primary G(z_prior) pushforward probe per step across coupled AE/VAE reconstruction forwards and tune equilibrium secant ceiling delta_g_max = (0.020 + 0.23 * min(1.5, ema_res))."
