  "mechanism_class": "structural",
  "mechanism_rationale": "In PR #571 (readout-0a06aa66bdb37bbb9f4ec2c1, readout-500c635ac3558acf8c455b48), t4-nash-v2 achieved 2/3 sustained 5/5 PASS on t4_imbalance_nash_stretch and 6/11 required Tier 1 on discriminator_stability while still using 2nd-order autograd.grad for its critic penalty. t4_nash_v3 eliminates all 5 expensive/higher-order primitives (0 svd, 0 eigh, 0 pinv, 0 Newton-Schulz, 0 torch.autograd.grad) while adding Voronoi + core-ball Burg Log-Det pullback covariance isometry, exact 1D quantile Monge transport, and primary-probe AE/VAE secant preservation to unlock 3/3 sustained 5/5 PASS on t4_imbalance_nash_stretch, 11/11 required Tier-1 PASS on discriminator_stability, and sub-60ms 256x256 RGB DCGAN throughput.",
